    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61371" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωπ-ηλᾰτέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pull an oar, row</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυβερνῆσαι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Rh.Al.</u>
				1435a28
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.2.1
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>of any similar motion forwards and backwards</i>, as of a
			carpenter using an auger, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρύπανον κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Cyc.</u>
					461
				</span></i>
			.</div>
